# StreamList rules

- Screens must not call `fetch` or `axios` directly. Use the existing hooks and `src/api/client.ts`.
- Do not import `axios` outside `src/api/client.ts`.
- Use `StyleSheet.create` only for styling. No Tailwind, NativeWind, styled-components, or third-party UI kits.
- Read colors from `src/theme/colors.ts` and spacing from `src/theme/spacing.ts` only (no arbitrary hex or pixel literals in feature components except where the platform requires `0`/`1` hairlines unrelated to layout borders).
- Do not use `any` types; keep `strict` TypeScript.
- Do not add 1px solid borders for layout; use tonal layering and spacing per the design system.
- Never commit secrets; use `.env` locally and keep placeholders in `.env.example`.
